    "domain": "Natural Sciences",
    "framing": "How did the medical community come to accept that most peptic ulcers arise from bacterial infection rather than from excess acid produced by stress, and what evidence settled the dispute?",
    "split": "test",
    "word_count": 431,
    "generator": "claude-opus-5",
